  "query_preview": "..\n(Friday night through next Wednesday)\nIssued at 1122 AM CDT Thu Sep 3 2026\n\nAlthough we lose the precip chances this weekend through the middle \nof next week, the only bit of good news is that the heat dome \nreturning to the southern Great Plains this weekend won't be too \nformidable with H5 heights holding in the lower 5900s. Daily highs\nin the 90s on the Caprock with upper 90s/100s off the Caprock \nlook on track before the upper high potentially shifts farther \neast by Wednesday or Thursday. Should this occur, we could expect\nmonsoonal moisture to creep closer to us, especially by late week\ninto the weekend.",
